   - Dynamic Visibility Footprint Circle & Beacon
   - Home Base Location Marker & 24h Pass Predictions
   - DSKY Telemetry Registers & City Configurator
   - Space Mission Control Theme Synchronization (Zero-White-Background)
====================================================================
"""

